{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e65eec8e89ff9ab2e78651ba0fbf89840f1690cb34d7f57dbac21d06393501f0","ja":"へへっ！　そう簡単に点は入れさせないぜ！\nえいっ、レシーブ！","zh":"嘿嘿！可没那么容易让你们得分！\n看招，接球！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"67c4d893f16dc1c9a08b3d1e632f5737280c53fbf4b6a49970889130e53ce0a2","ja":"戻ってきた！　トスは茜ちゃんにおまかせだよっ☆\nえいっ！","zh":"球回来了！托球就交给我小茜吧☆\n嘿！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"e14078261c07f1c1c75a4510d5291086ed49f86a0d7dba8999e0a5fb783b117c","ja":"可奈ちゃん、いったよ～！\nバッチリ決めちゃって♪","zh":"小可奈，接好哦～！\n完美地秀一把吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"6dd769814f5a63e0c914aa77d195f9d6fe685741a411e30a428687957cf56392","ja":"ええっ、私！？\nえ、えっと、えっと……え、えーい！","zh":"咦，我！？\n那个、那个，那个……不、不管了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"6b931f69e125fb4769c2c3bb05ea245550b25df5d9d97df9a12e3327401cc6f3","ja":"やったーっ！　決まった……のかな？","zh":"太棒啦——！搞定……了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"78f5d95d78a7569444b576c5e24257a25f39cea0f1cec581e14650d959955b69","ja":"う～ん……どうかな？\nねえねえ、つむりん、審判としての判断はどう？","zh":"嗯～……怎么样呢？\n我说我说，小紬，作为裁判你的判断如何？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"8dc3bff23b851c5316dda9e95b1d128564426380f19e0ef7100a32b8da804023","ja":"えっ、私ですか！？　そ、そうですね……ジャンプの\n高さを考えると、ボールはネットに当たっているかと。","zh":"咦，我吗！？这、这个嘛……考虑到跳跃的\n高度，球应该是碰到网了吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"427e5de4ca5cd3ab5f6ed715aed64d11fe84d6dcca78e2d49f37f9aba2c19982","ja":"ってことは、こっちの得点か。やったぜ！","zh":"也就是说，算我们得分啊。太棒啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"6d6509860583256b1dfae493d641ba68b06d14a9cfa479627a8a15c591697f8e","ja":"……って感じ♪\nどう？　やってみたら、意外とできそうだよね♪","zh":"……大概是这种感觉♪\n怎么样？试着做做看的话，意外地感觉挺能办到的吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[53].text","source_sha256":"cd4e4feaf18b458ba46fd936dc976595a57b00056a9525a0d8876fadb27600c4","ja":"うん！　いきなりでビックリしたけど、\nお芝居だって思ったら、大丈夫かも。","zh":"嗯！虽然事发突然吓了一跳，\n但只要当成是在演戏，说不定就没问题了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[54].text","source_sha256":"c2c4fa924be21180abb2776c4d3aac82ab80e44977c8a30f0c4c402b212c7ade","ja":"茜ちゃんもバッチリだよ☆\nこの調子でどんどんいっちゃおう♪","zh":"小茜也完全没问题哦☆\n保持这个势头继续冲吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[63].text","source_sha256":"26bad7a9a0e63c7b8e956ffc3986f65b4a48ad74c64be68c4f7a5220d7922633","ja":"30分後……","zh":"30分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[64].text","source_sha256":"db5291559530433195a1871c81c27c84120c0e27b6830c655366957a2a67e75d","ja":"じゃあ次は、水上アスレチックだ！\n海美！　競争しようぜ♪","zh":"那接下来，去玩水上闯关运动吧！\n海美！我们来比赛吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[65].text","source_sha256":"2d457ee606c9e2aa27d46e2a637ae6de946ae88033d7d6f9168b6ccf37efe58a","ja":"OK！　よーい……どん！　ちょっと走りづらいけど、\n波の上を走ってるみたいで面白いよね☆","zh":"OK！各就各位……跑！虽然有点难跑，\n但感觉就像在波浪上奔跑一样，挺有意思的吧☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[72].text","source_sha256":"ba3a1c692b7cdff1e39be9a377abe8857410ee2406efe336bd984e6b72587a19","ja":"では、私達は滝へ……。壮大なのに、\n眺めていると心が落ち着く……ような気がいたします。","zh":"那么，我们去瀑布那边吧……虽说气势雄伟，\n但只要远眺着它，感觉内心就会平静下来……呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1628.unity3d","item_key":"commands[73].text","source_sha256":"265e013ea40b0e3ca6b9172158ba2af5ce1b6cccd1fbdaa3d90df1b4712a48bb","ja":"水しぶきが、気持ちいい～♪　それじゃあ次は……\n海辺にぴったりのスイーツ～♪　南国のフルーツ～♪","zh":"溅起的水花，好舒服～♪ 那么接下来是……\n最适合海边的甜点～♪ 南国的水果～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
